    "text": "1 ns Apeement made as of thes] st day of Jamiaryy 2001, by.and between Wells Fargo an nesota, N.A., or it’s agent, (berein ‘the “Bank\") and thé Copic Insurance Company (herein Participant\"), ‘ ie"
