    "id": "c013",
    "name": "9. Termination",
    "text": "9. Termination , * This Agreement may be terminated at any time by either Participant or the Bank upon 60 days written notice to the other. Upon delivery of such notice and upon, tautual agreement, cither party may waive all or part of the Notice period and the Bank will terminate loans from Participant's Account in accordance with Borrower Security Loan Agreements,"
