    "name": "10. Notices—Agent",
    "text": "Notice to the Agent shall be directed and mailed as follows:. Wells Fargo Bank Minnesota NLA. Institutional Investments, Securities Lending Wells Fargo Center MAC N9305-090 Sixth Street and Marquette Avenue Minneapolis, MN 55479 ATIN: Robert G, Smith, Managing Director"
